{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recently, a journalist hoping to make a name for herself has come across a number of recent criminal cases.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She has begun taking these cases apart in a bid for fame one at a time. Her first such case involves a missing person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You play as this missing person and get to experience his story.</strong> You will experience environmental horror and stories of the many characters involved. As the player solves puzzles and travels between different environments, the struggle of memory loss keeps the player guessing as he uncovers his captor's twisted story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579380/extras/Butcher_Cell.gif?t=1745332640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player must persevere, recover his memories, and escape before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579380/extras/interactables.gif?t=1745332640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can expect to enter a 90's narrative-based psychological horror, where they get to experience a series of grim, dark, and very immersive environments while solving puzzles and unraveling the horror within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579380/extras/Forest.gif?t=1745332640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive experience.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Telling.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological horror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2D and 3D Scares.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Puzzles.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579380?t=1745332640","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579380?t=1745332640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579380/5d2b4092bad47982ede39188f2ceab4a5e23dbf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745332640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579380/5d2b4092bad47982ede39188f2ceab4a5e23dbf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745332640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Horrifying images that contain gore and blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recently, a journalist hoping to make a name for herself has come across a number of recent criminal cases.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She has begun taking these cases apart in a bid for fame one at a time. Her first such case involves a missing person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You play as this missing person and get to experience his story.</strong> You will experience environmental horror and stories of the many characters involved. As the player solves puzzles and travels between different environments, the struggle of memory loss keeps the player guessing as he uncovers his captor's twisted story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579380/extras/Butcher_Cell.gif?t=1745332640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player must persevere, recover his memories, and escape before it